  Revenue in **2024 Q3** was **$8,461,841.81**. The **Midwest declin
  (whatever the run did, replay reproduces it — including a refusal)

--- replaying, three times ---
   0.07s   0 tokens billed   5 cassette hits, 0 misses
   0.07s   0 tokens billed   5 cassette hits, 0 misses
